    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.size
      value: 28
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[0].Text
      value: 'You run into what seems to be a hog man harassing a hog woman. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[1].Text
      value: Guhhhhh.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[2].Text
      value: Someone help!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[3].Text
      value: What's going on, meow?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[4].Text
      value: "He\u2019s been brainwashed and he\u2019s attacking anything that comes
        near him."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[5].Text
      value: I need someone to help me bash him over the head to wake him up.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[6].Text
      value: I ca-
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[7].Text
      value: I need someone stronger than you fishsticks, sorry.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[8].Text
      value: Cat, you look like you can handle yourself.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[9].Text
      value: "Isn\u2019t that a little violent, meow?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[10].Text
      value: "It\u2019s his fault for getting himself brainwashed in the first place.
        I\u2019ll hold him down and you hit him in the way I show you."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[11].Text
      value: Oh, okay, meow!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[12].Text
      value: 3... 2... 1... Now! Get him!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[13].Text
      value: Mreooooowwwww! *cat noises*
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[14].Text
      value: Ugh... What happened?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[15].Text
      value: Has that cleared up your head now? Or do you need to be hit a few more
        times to get your head straight?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[16].Text
      value: Yeah... My head hurts... I remember seeing a strang goat man and then,
        nothing...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[17].Text
      value: You were brainwashed by him and you completely trampled the flowers!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[18].Text
      value: Oh...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[19].Text
      value: OH NO! The tulips!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[20].Text
      value: You'll help me replant all of them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[21].Text
      value: Well, if that's all you needed, then I think I'll head off, meow.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[22].Text
      value: Thank you so much for the help.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[23].Text
      value: Thanks, is there anything we can do for you?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[24].Text
      value: No worries, meow! In fact, I feel stronger just knowing I helped.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[25].Text
      value: And you are right, you do feel stronger.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[26].Text
      value: After this encounter you've learned a new move, "Cattack".
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[27].Text
      value: No worries, meow! In fact, I feel stronger just knowing I helped.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
